WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.069
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.297
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:09.346
They see a music store.

4
00:00:09.347 --> 00:00:17.725
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:37.493
They make noise with a tuba.

6
00:00:37.494 --> 00:00:53.250
They make noise with a tambourine.

7
00:00:53.251 --> 00:01:16.621
They make noise with a violin.

8
00:01:16.622 --> 00:01:30.801
They make noise with a guitar.

9
00:01:30.802 --> 00:01:49.603
They make noise with a drum set.

10
00:01:49.604 --> 00:02:02.708
They make noise with a keyboard.

11
00:02:02.709 --> 00:02:09.990
Wow, what a cool band!

12
00:02:09.991 --> 00:02:14.656
Blobs, can you play music now?

13
00:02:14.657 --> 00:02:19.613
No, they can't.

14
00:02:19.614 --> 00:02:25.000
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:25.001 --> 00:02:26.954
Good-bye!

